  "metadata": {
    "title": "Synthetic instructions scale task diversity",
    "description": "FLAN creates many natural-language phrasings across tasks. Self-Instruct samples seed tasks, generates new instructions and instances, filters near-duplicates and adds survivors to a growing pool. Classification uses output-first generation to reduce label imbalance; LIMA emphasizes a small set of high-quality examples."
  }
